      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like the latency is very noticeable with desktop/flatscreen mode as well. The rate at which the player's look direction is updated slowly, so that if you nod really fast, it doesn't look like you're nodding as much as you are. There is also a noticeable delay before players move on the other player's end. I feel like these issues should definitely be looked into and improved by VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
